  "description": {
    "text": "Gen Con 2003, held at the Indiana Convention Center in Indianapolis from 24 to 27 July 2003, is regarded as the very last Wizards of the Coast event in competitive Pokémon, with a Team Play Championship and a Fan Appreciation Tournament. Holofoil Groudon ex and Kyogre ex, the first Nintendo Black Star Promos, were given away there, Groudon ex at the booth of Pokémon USA, which had just taken the English card game over. Best of Game's Professor Elm was given out there too; unlike the other Best of Game cards it never had a Winner-stamped or jumbo copy.",
